WEBVTT

00:03:26.619 --> 00:03:31.916
And with these, the players can craft
their own unique metaverses.

00:03:32.625 --> 00:03:35.461
The metaverses, therefore,
belong to the players.

00:03:35.461 --> 00:03:38.881
They do not belong to us, making the game.

00:03:38.881 --> 00:03:41.008
And like, ah, it’s so fascinating,

00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:44.428
because the players are so very,
very creative with the metaverses.

00:03:44.428 --> 00:03:47.723
Some use them to be like,
big cities, castles,

00:03:47.723 --> 00:03:51.686
or like my five-year-old
daughter's recent project,

00:03:51.686 --> 00:03:54.438
an underwater playground for fishes.

00:03:56.607 --> 00:04:00.569
And some players are engineers and build
the most complex machines.